cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "iceland-volcano-watch: open-data analysis of the Svartsengi magma accumulation (GNSS, Sentinel-1)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ismoilov
    given-names: Otabek
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2785-3691"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24288620"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bristleconelab/iceland-volcano-watch"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Svartsengi
  - Reykjanes Peninsula
  - magma accumulation
  - GNSS
  - InSAR
  - deformation source
abstract: >-
  Reproducible open-data analysis of the 2023-2026 Svartsengi inflation: station dependence of point-source
  magma volumes, radar "virtual station" maps, joint GNSS and Sentinel-1 source fits (point, line, compound
  dislocation model), with all derived tables, figures and tests.
